	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nuncio <placeName ref="l291">Lindaviensi</placeName> iam abituro hasce ad te dare volui, domine colendissime, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quibus indicare quam primum tibi possem rem magni momenti ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> nuper <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>allatam, quam constans fama confirmat.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p20183">Albanus</persName> et <persName ref="p20950">pontifex</persName> cum <persName ref="p20778">duce Nortfoldien<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>si</persName> conspirarunt promittentes se illi auxilio fore, ut <placeName ref="l2524">Scotię</placeName> reginam captam uxo<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>rem simulque <placeName ref="l2524">Scotię</placeName> et <placeName ref="l830">Anglię</placeName> regnum obtineat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Venerunt prope <placeName ref="l830">Angliam</placeName> 40 <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>naves militares ad diem constitutum expectantes <placeName ref="l722">Nortfoldiensis</placeName> et eius <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>sociorum naves socias, quae occurrerent, ut una ex improviso <placeName ref="l296">Londinum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>irruerent et depraedarentur, reginam <placeName ref="l830">Anglię</placeName> caperent.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Deo autem ita volente <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><placeName ref="l722">Nortfoldiensis</placeName> suos ad diem constitutum colligere non potuit, itaque naves <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>illę 40, cum diu expectantes nullas sibi occurrentes socios conspicerent, prope <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>sese inde proripuerunt (appulerant autem circa Dabran urbem vel portum), <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>metuerunt, ne <placeName ref="l830">Angli</placeName> ipsas conspicerent et conspectas insequerentur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Res <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ad reginam delata est, <placeName ref="l722">Nortfoldiensis</placeName>, qui antea illi suspectus erat, capitur, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>deprehenduntur apud ipsum literę continentes omnem coniurationis formam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>atque ordinem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Hinc multi alii in carcerem coniecti sunt; quid de illis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>futurum sit, expectatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ante paucos qu<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>oque dies affertur <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>mulos 50 onustos ex <placeName ref="l875">Hispania</placeName> <placeName ref="l301">Lugdunum</placeName> versus profectos esse, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quasi crocum ferrent; erant autem non croco, sed 40 illorum argento, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>10 auro onusti, quos omnes Hugonothi coeperunt in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName>; mittebantur <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>isti ad <persName ref="p20183">Albanum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nunc rumor vanus spargitur pecuniam illam omnem <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>mercatorum fuisse.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p20183">Albanus</persName> etiamnum pergit insectari crudelissime <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>fideles.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Dominus eorum... misereatur vindicetque tandem suos.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Victoria <placeName ref="l522">Venetorum</placeName> contra <placeName ref="l2510">Turcas</placeName> confirmatur et iactatur insolenter; interim <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>a quibusdam cordatis percipio vicisse quidem <placeName ref="l522">Venetos</placeName>, sed non absque damn <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nec damnum <placeName ref="l2510">Turcis</placeName> tantum allatum, quantum iactarunt; cecidere <placeName ref="l2510">Turcarum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ad 20 m, christianorum ad 10 m. Ista, rogo, etiam d. m. <persName ref="p8011">Rod[olpho] <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Gvalthero</persName> communices eique salutem meo nomine officiosissimam dicas; <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nam festinare cogor scribendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale cum omnibus tuis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Datum <placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> 7. novembris anno 71.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>T[uae] r[everentiae] observantissimus <persName ref="p3740">Georgius a Stetten</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem ehrwirdigen unnd <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>gelertten herrn <persName ref="p495">Henrichen <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullinger</persName>, dienern der <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>kirchen zu <placeName ref="l587">Zürch</placeName>, meinem <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>lieben herrn unnd freünd.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürch</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
